        "category": "classfeature",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round; <strong>Trigger</strong> A creature you can see damages you.</p><hr /><p>Choose one &mdash; <strong>(a)</strong> gain resistance equal to <strong>twice your highest Depth</strong> against that damage, or <strong>(b)</strong> if the triggering creature is within your reach, make a <strong>Carapace Strike</strong> against it. It does not stack with Carapace Block against the same damage.</p><p><em>Use it as the damage is rolled. Choice (a) arms the plate for the next damage you take this round and is taken off it as it lands &mdash; with Carapace Block also armed, only the larger of the two applies. For (b), Strike.</em></p>"
